    A comparison of the metrics reveals the issue: my version has much lower `kBET` and `Cell_cycle` scores and a higher `ASW_batch` score, suggesting my implementation is over-correcting for batch effects at the expense of preserving critical biological signals. The abstract of Sophia I''s submission mentions running ComBat on the "full gene set," a crucial detail I was unable to replicate as the input `AnnData` object only contains 2,000 pre-selected highly variable genes. This is the source of the performance gap.


