role: model
parts:
- text: "My reflection is complete. I have a clear, two-stage plan to investigate my \"Add-Back\" hypothesis. I will now execute the first stage.\n\nFirst, I will go to the Research Counter. Then, I will submit my probe experiment to verify the core assumptions of my new hypothesis.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Utility Probe: Feasibility of Cell Cycle Scoring\"\ntags: [\"utility\", \"cell-cycle\", \"probe\", \"hypothesis-testing\"]\nabstract: |\n  This is a non-scored utility submission to test the feasibility of my \"Add-Back\" hypothesis. The `test` function will attempt to run `sc.tl.score_genes_cell_cycle` on the input data to see if it produces a non-trivial score, despite the lack of canonical cell cycle genes. It will also print the first principal component of the uncorrected data. The results will determine if the \"Add-Back\" experiment is viable.\ncontent: |\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import numpy as np\n\
    \n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    # This function will not be called\n    return adata\n\n  def test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    \"\"\"\n    Probe to test feasibility of \"Add-Back\" hypothesis.\n    1. Can we score cell cycle genes?\n    2. What is the first PC of the uncorrected data?\n    \"\"\"\n    # Canonical cell cycle genes from Tirosh et al. (2016)\n    s_genes = [\"MCM5\", \"PCNA\", \"TYMS\", \"FEN1\", \"MCM2\", \"MCM4\", \"RRM1\", \"UNG\", \"GINS2\", \"MCM6\", \"CDCA7\", \"DTL\", \"PRIM1\", \"UHRF1\", \"MLF1IP\", \"HELLS\", \"RFC2\", \"RPA2\", \"NASP\", \"RAD51AP1\", \"GMNN\", \"WDR76\", \"SLBP\", \"CCNE2\", \"UBR7\", \"POLD3\", \"MSH2\", \"ATAD2\", \"RAD51\", \"RRM2\", \"CDC45\", \"CDC6\", \"EXO1\", \"TIPIN\", \"DSCC1\", \"BLM\", \"CASP8AP2\", \"USP1\", \"CLSPN\", \"POLA1\", \"CHAF1B\", \"BRIP1\", \"E2F8\"]\n    g2m_genes = [\"HMGB2\", \"CDK1\", \"HMGN2\", \"NDC80\", \"CBX5\", \"SMC4\", \"CENPA\", \"CENPF\", \"CENPE\", \"CTCF\", \"NEK2\"\
    , \"G2E3\", \"GAS2L3\", \"CBX3\", \"STAT1\", \"BIRC5\", \"AURKA\", \"AURKB\", \"TPX2\", \"TOP2A\", \"E2F1\", \"HMGB1\", \"RANGAP1\", \"SMC2\", \"HDGF\", \"SMC1A\", \"NCAPD2\", \"ANP32E\", \"CENP_F\", \"CKAP2\", \"NUSAP1\", \"DLGAP5\", \"CDCA8\", \"ECT2\", \"KIF23\", \"H2AFZ\", \"PSRC1\", \"CNAP1\", \"TROAP\", \"ASPM\", \"BUB1\", \"KIF2C\", \"KIF11\", \"KIF20B\", \"CCNB2\", \"CCNA2\", \"CDC20\", \"CDC25C\", \"NUF2\", \"UBE2C\", \"ANLN\", \"LBR\", \"CKS1B\", \"CKS2\", \"MKI67\", \"TMPO\", \"PIM1\", \"TACC3\", \"SGO1\", \"JPT1\", \"PLK1\", \"BUB1B\", \"CCNB1\"]\n    \n    adata_test = adata.copy()\n    \n    # Pre-process for scoring\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_test)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_test)\n    \n    print(\"--- 1. Testing Cell Cycle Scoring ---\")\n    try:\n        # Use feature_name for matching\n        sc.tl.score_genes_cell_cycle(adata_test, s_genes=s_genes, g2m_genes=g2m_genes, var_names={'s_genes': 'feature_name', 'g2m_genes': 'feature_name'})\n        print(\"Cell cycle\
    \ scoring successful.\")\n        print(\"Score statistics:\")\n        print(adata_test.obs['S_score'].describe())\n        print(adata_test.obs['G2M_score'].describe())\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Cell cycle scoring failed: {e}\")\n\n    print(\"\\n--- 2. Calculating First Principal Component ---\")\n    try:\n        adata_pca = adata.copy()\n        sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_pca)\n        sc.pp.log1p(adata_pca)\n        sc.pp.pca(adata_pca, n_comps=1)\n        pc1_vector = adata_pca.varm['PCs'][:, 0]\n        print(\"First PC vector (first 10 elements):\")\n        print(pc1_vector[:10])\n        print(f\"PC1 Vector Norm: {np.linalg.norm(pc1_vector)}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"PCA calculation failed: {e}\")\n\n    return \"Probe experiment complete. Check logs.\"\n```"
